/ActualText (This case study focuses on designing a seamless and user-friendly recurring bill payment experience for a mobile banking application.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to help users automate their monthly electricity bill payments securely, efficiently, and with minimal effort while ensuring accessibility, transparency, and trust throughout the process.)
