/ActualText (A user wants to set up an automatic recurring payment for their monthly electricity bill through a mobile banking application.\r\n\r\nThe challenge is to create a secure, intuitive, and accessible experience that allows users to automate payments with minimal effort while maintaining clarity, trust, and flexibility.)
