<<
/K [3454 0 R]
/S /P
/Type /StructElem
/P 3246 0 R
>>
endobj
3456 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (Additional Features & UX Improvements\n\n" Pre-Deduction Alerts\(Users receive reminders 48 hours before payment deduction.\n\n" One-Tap Pause AutoPay\(Quickly pause recurring payments during billing disputes or emergencies.\n\n" Maximum Payment Limit\(Users can set a bill amount threshold for safer AutoPay control.\n\n" Smart Bill Insights\(Monthly electricity usage and payment trend tracking.\n\n" Biometric Authentication\(Support for Face ID and Fingerprint verification.\n\n" Low Balance Alerts\(Notify users if account balance is insufficient before payment.\n\n" Bill Limit Exceeded Notifications\(AutoPay pauses if the bill exceeds the user-defined limit.\n\n" Status Indicators\(Active, Paused, and Failed payment badges for better visibility.\n\n" Accessibility Support\(High contrast text, screen reader compatibility, and accessible touch targets.\n\n" Live Support Assistance\(Quick access to FAQs, live chat, and customer support.)
/K [105]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 3457 0 R
/Pg 1455 0 R
>>
